  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing MLAILPKC&#x2019;s Capacities for Effective Peace Support Operations in West Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &#x2018;Enhancing MLAILPKC&#x2019;s Capacities for Effective Peace Support Operations in West African Project&#x2019; is designed to advance democracy and national cohesion, peaceful co-existence and preserve the well-being of civilians in armed conflicts in West Africa. The main goal of this project will be achieved through an output: &#x2018;Capacities of security agencies and relevant stakeholders for leadership and national cohesion, counter-violent extremism and protection of civilians in armed conflicts enhanced</narrative>
  </description>
